    <string name="help_body">Today — two blocks: Morning and Evening. The one that fits now is open: morning until it is done, then evening (tap the other to open it). In a block, tap a supplement to mark it taken (tap again to undo); below are a few 1–5 ratings. Everything is saved at once.\n\nSleep is counted on its own: the first morning tick is your wake-up, the evening tick is bedtime (plus the time-to-sleep setting).\n\nHistory — sleep, wellbeing, adherence, costs, a calendar (tap a day: what was taken and when, ratings; you can add what you forgot) and each supplement: how you feel on days with and without it.\n\nCabinet and settings (the button at the bottom right) — everything else: supplements by category (tap — the card: dose, schedule, pack, “bought a new one”, delete), alternation groups, JSON schema and backup, rating questions, look.\n\nLeave unknowns empty: mg, stock, price. Then there is simply no forecast or cost instead of wrong numbers.</string>
